Description: Linux desktop GUI for Subversion repository management
 SVN Server Admin provides a graphical interface for system administrators
 managing Subversion repositories on Linux.
 .
 Features include:
  - Create, delete, inspect, and hot-copy repositories
  - User, group, and path-based access control (svnserve.conf / authz)
  - Hook script editor with shell syntax highlighting for all 9 hook types
  - Effective access checker with transitive group expansion
  - SMTP outgoing mail profile manager with test-send capability
  - Automated backup and repository verification scheduler
  - svnserve daemon status and control panel
